		"description": "Leonardo's drawing places the human body at the center of Circle (divine) and Square (earthly). But digital bodies are meshes—vertices that can distort, explode, reconfigure. Decompose the Vitruvian ideal into frequencies. Break the cage of perfection. Discover queer morphology: the body not as Being (static ideal) but as Becoming (fluid process).",
